--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Examination documents used as test fixtures
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    tests/Fixtures/portfolio/e5-synthesis-2026.xlsx

is the « Modèle de tableau de synthèse, annexe VI-1 » of the BTS SIO, session
2026, published by the SIEC (Service interacadémique des examens et concours,
Éducation nationale). It is a public examination document, NOT covered by the
AGPL; it is kept only to test the template inspection and is absent from the
production image. The application never ships an official template: the
administration uploads the one of each session.

    tests/Fixtures/rncp/export-fiches-rncp-extract.xml

is an extract (fiches RNCP35340 and RNCP40792) of France compétences' export of
the Répertoire national des certifications professionnelles, published on
data.gouv.fr under the Licence Ouverte 2.0 (Etalab), 2026-09-29.

